00:13:32.578 --> 00:13:35.757
You guys are nicer than what I'd expect
from someone with your face color.

00:13:35.781 --> 00:13:38.148
| lied! We ain't got money!

00:13:38.284 --> 00:13:40.150
You guys work hard. Later.

00:13:42.188 --> 00:13:44.247
How dare they mess with us?!

00:13:44.757 --> 00:13:46.247
Ran!

00:13:46.592 --> 00:13:49.304
Yo!

00:13:49.328 --> 00:13:51.296
Oh! Buy some gal-pastries!

00:13:51.697 --> 00:13:51.706
Buy some! Buy some! Buy some! Buy some!

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.675
| don't like sweet things.
Buy some! Buy some! Buy some! Buy some!

00:13:53.699 --> 00:13:53.858
Buy some! Buy some! Buy some! Buy some!

00:13:54.166 --> 00:13:56.778
What?! You're a real cold iceman!

00:13:56.802 --> 00:13:58.770
Help us out a little to get our sales up!

00:13:59.104 --> 00:14:00.615
Forcing your product on customers?

00:14:00.639 --> 00:14:02.884
Our goal is to sell out by the time we close.

00:14:02.908 --> 00:14:04.519
And we've got 3000.

00:14:04.543 --> 00:14:06.254
What?! 3000?!

00:14:06.278 --> 00:14:07.905
Isn't that rough?

00:14:08.147 --> 00:14:10.639
Ran, I'll help you. Just tell me what to do.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:14.095
Hey, that's my Second Place! You're a
nice guy, unlike SOME iceman we know.

00:14:14.119 --> 00:14:15.864
Then, you want me to start
calling out to customers?

00:14:15.888 --> 00:14:17.686
Hey, I just had a great idea!

00:14:20.826 --> 00:14:23.371
Hello, I'm Yuya Asou,
the second place winner

00:14:23.395 --> 00:14:25.420
of the Super High School
Student Grand Prix!

00:14:26.999 --> 00:14:30.458
My number one pick and the favorite
among many other GL guys,

00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:35.474
the Shibuya specialty, gal-pastries,
are currently on sale over here!

00:14:37.209 --> 00:14:42.424
Rei Otohata of the Super High School
Student Grand Prix also loves them too!

00:14:42.448 --> 00:14:45.816
Hey, don't use my name without my permission. Come
on, you better hurry or it's going to be all sold out!

00:14:46.385 --> 00:14:48.649
I'd like some gal-pastries!

00:14:50.522 --> 00:14:52.149
Perfecto!

00:14:53.225 --> 00:14:55.159
Yes, thank you very much.

00:14:55.261 --> 00:14:57.662
Twenty? Please wait a moment.

00:15:04.436 --> 00:15:06.114
I'm really sorry.

00:15:06.138 --> 00:15:09.403
We tried hard, but we ended up
with some leftover.

00:15:10.042 --> 00:15:12.977
Oh, it's okay. As long as you make up
for it tomorrow.

00:15:13.345 --> 00:15:15.905
Really, Sir? Thank you very much.

00:15:16.048 --> 00:15:17.726
Where are the other two?

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.718
Oh, they're changing right now.

00:15:19.919 --> 00:15:21.387
| see.

00:15:23.289 --> 00:15:26.725
The truth is, there's a reason
| hired you on.

00:15:27.393 --> 00:15:28.503
Sir?

00:15:28.527 --> 00:15:31.224
You want money right now, don't you?

00:15:32.064 --> 00:15:34.499
Yes, well, that's right.

00:15:34.733 --> 00:15:36.278
In that case,

00:15:36.302 --> 00:15:38.737
would you like me to introduce you
to a higher-paying job?

00:15:40.572 --> 00:15:44.770
| have a side business, where I help
place part-time workers.

00:15:45.544 --> 00:15:48.356
Oh, I'm sure it's nothing unusual

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.281
for frivolous high school kids like you guys.

00:15:54.186 --> 00:15:55.813
You see what I'm getting at, don't you?

00:15:59.325 --> 00:16:01.225
You could get at least a million a month.

00:16:01.894 --> 00:16:05.421
| think that would be more your kind of work.

00:16:08.867 --> 00:16:10.699
Well? Wanna give it a try?

00:16:12.004 --> 00:16:13.529
Don't touch me.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.475
| said, don't touch me!

00:16:24.683 --> 00:16:29.177
You think I'm stupid! You lined up all
those damn dirty lies!

00:16:29.722 --> 00:16:33.317
You're just a rotten adult, so quit trying
to throw your weight around!

00:16:33.625 --> 00:16:36.686
Apologize, Mister! Get down on your
knees and apologize!

00:16:39.431 --> 00:16:41.661
Like hell I'll apologize to a brat like you.

00:16:42.668 --> 00:16:44.830
| said, apologize!

00:16:52.811 --> 00:16:54.905
Just leave it at that, Miyu.

00:16:56.682 --> 00:16:58.411
Did that wake you up?

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:03.052
What the hell are you doing?!

00:17:03.255 --> 00:17:06.782
Sorry about that, my hand just SLIPPED!

00:17:06.992 --> 00:17:09.552
Whoops, it slipped again.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.223
Why you little...

00:17:14.266 --> 00:17:16.200
Like I said, my HAND...

00:17:20.072 --> 00:17:22.803
...just SLIPPED!

00:17:26.712 --> 00:17:28.680
Miyu, let's go home.

00:17:30.049 --> 00:17:31.676
Miyu?

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:36.681
Hey...

00:17:36.822 --> 00:17:40.781
| didn't know what I was doing just now.

00:17:41.527 --> 00:17:43.171
Everything was jumbled up in my mind and...

00:17:43.195 --> 00:17:45.940
Everything you had bottled up
probably exploded.

00:17:45.964 --> 00:17:48.276
Well, it's a good lesson for
this dumb-ass though.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:51.235
In the end, Miyu's just a hypocrite and a liar!

00:17:52.304 --> 00:17:53.848
| talk about wanting to be independent,

00:17:53.872 --> 00:17:56.603
but the truth is, I can't live without
depending on someone else!

00:17:57.676 --> 00:18:00.338
And I'm NOT okay about my parents at all!

00:18:05.584 --> 00:18:07.643
It's lonely being on my own.

00:18:08.253 --> 00:18:09.948
| don't wanna be alone!

00:18:10.522 --> 00:18:13.514
I'm scared of being by myself!

00:18:16.662 --> 00:18:20.121
Ran, I called your brother,
like you told me to.

00:18:20.632 --> 00:18:23.311
He said to come over to your house,
because he wants to talk.

00:18:23.335 --> 00:18:25.269
