00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.816
No! It's gonna be about breaking up, I know it!

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:30.241
Yamato's probably gotten fed up with me!

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:32.087
It's over! I wanna die!

00:18:32.111 --> 00:18:33.806
Come on, Miyu.

00:18:33.879 --> 00:18:36.348
<i>Quit jumping to conclusions on your own
about everything</i>

00:18:36.515 --> 00:18:38.779
and just go see for yourself.

00:18:46.492 --> 00:18:50.019
So, it WAS you! Yamato's girlfriend!

00:18:50.195 --> 00:18:52.926
We've heard a lot of things
about you from Ran.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.267
Miyu's circumstances are exactly
like I told you just now.

00:18:57.803 --> 00:18:59.635
| plan to marry her someday,

00:18:59.738 --> 00:19:01.638
so I thought I'd formally
introduce you to her.

00:19:02.341 --> 00:19:03.618
Marry?!

00:19:03.642 --> 00:19:05.487
Yeah, is that a no?

00:19:05.511 --> 00:19:07.946
Those were my intentions all along.

00:19:09.648 --> 00:19:10.692
Not at all.

00:19:10.716 --> 00:19:12.445
It's not a no at all.

00:19:12.718 --> 00:19:14.982
I'm glad. Then there's no problem.

00:19:15.354 --> 00:19:18.051
What's going on with Bro?!

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:20.001
They're engaged, datchu.

00:19:20.025 --> 00:19:23.004
Yamato, now that you're engaged,

00:19:23.028 --> 00:19:25.707
you'd better take proper
responsibility as a man!

00:19:25.731 --> 00:19:27.927
| can't wait to see grandchildren.

00:19:28.834 --> 00:19:31.201
Yeah, I'll make her happy, I promise.

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:35.864
With grandkids, I'll finally be a grandpa.

00:19:36.475 --> 00:19:38.603
And I'll be a grandma.

00:19:49.521 --> 00:19:51.922
This is the first time I've seen
your room, Yamato.

00:19:52.324 --> 00:19:54.656
After all, you never let me in before.

00:19:55.561 --> 00:19:58.053
| heard about the tuition issue from Ran.

00:19:58.864 --> 00:20:01.709
If you can pass a scholarship exam
that's being held in March,

00:20:01.733 --> 00:20:03.745
