from the tuition.

00:20:03.769 --> 00:20:05.396
You want to try for it?

00:20:05.571 --> 00:20:07.164
Scholarship money?

00:20:07.773 --> 00:20:09.605
Could Miyu really get it?

00:20:10.142 --> 00:20:11.920
Let's solve our problems one at a time,

00:20:11.944 --> 00:20:13.912
starting with the ones we can do
something about.

00:20:14.346 --> 00:20:15.871
With a positive attitude.

00:20:16.248 --> 00:20:18.910
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.749
Hang in there for two more years.

00:20:24.223 --> 00:20:25.667
When you graduate from high school,

00:20:25.691 --> 00:20:27.955
let's get married and find
a place of our own.

00:20:28.493 --> 00:20:31.827
But until then, I might end up making
you feel lonely at times.

00:20:32.231 --> 00:20:34.199
Are you sure you're okay with Miyu?

00:20:34.933 --> 00:20:38.961
Miyu's always doing nothing
but making you worry.

00:20:40.372 --> 00:20:42.898
| didn't make this decision so halfheartedly.

00:20:44.109 --> 00:20:45.907
It'd always bothered me.

00:20:46.678 --> 00:20:49.857
Every so often, you would get this
really lonely look on your face

00:20:49.881 --> 00:20:51.747
and I wondered why.

00:20:52.951 --> 00:20:56.512
If it's because you're afraid of being
alone and worried about it,

00:20:57.055 --> 00:20:59.422
| wanted to show you that you shouldn't be.

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.198
You aren't alone.

00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:09.094
You have your friends and me.

00:21:09.968 --> 00:21:11.697
You're absolutely not alone.

00:21:12.204 --> 00:21:14.605
I'll spend the rest of my life proving it to you.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.700
Yamato!

00:21:22.714 --> 00:21:24.546
